      "side": "DRIVER",
      "reason_code": "IMPAIRMENT_UNDISCLOSED",
      "detail": "the claim cites impaired artifact EV-ADVIS-05009-01 at weight_multiplier 0.0 but does not name its issue code(s): MISSING_ARTIFACT"
    },
    {
      "claim": "POL-RD-24 requires exactly one row to apply, and the only refund row capable of reaching this trip — row (d), 'not traffic-justified, deviation over 1 km' — depends on a positive finding that the reroute was not justified. This record cannot make that finding: the traffic artifact is MISSING at weight 0.0 and is expressly not a finding of no traffic, POL-GEN-02 says it carries no fact, and POL-GEN-26 forbids inferring an outcome from the absence of evidence. With row (a) unavailable for want of the traffic data and row (d)'s predicate unestablished, the case fits no row, and POL-RD-24's own closing sentence routes a case that fits no row to escalation under POL-GEN-26.",
      "side": "DRIVER",
      "reason_code": "IMPAIRMENT_UNDISCLOSED",
      "detail": "the claim cites impaired artifact EV-ADVIS-05009-01 at weight_multiplier 0.0 but does not name its issue code(s): MISSING_ARTIFACT"
    }
  ]
}
